{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Pipis\n🥚 Blue oval-shaped objects/\"enemies\" from the Cyber World, closely tied to Spamton — his own Check calls them \"clams,\" but Spamton insists on calling them \"eggs.\"","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pipis_item.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":165},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Spamton**\nThey're literally \"his eggs\" — he uses them as a weapon, as a healing source, and as his most iconic attack in his NEO form, where his nose becomes a beak and produces Pipis like bird eggs.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nShe received a digital Pipis from Spamton before Ch.2, as thanks for reading his spam mail — she put it into \"Cat Petterz 2\" and the object multiplied on its own until it crashed the game.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nKeeps one hidden in a drawer, embarrassed by it despite her public disdain for Spamton — one of the most revealing details about how hypocritical her rivalry is.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nIt's speculated that Pipis (described as \"clams,\" a protein source) are part of what draws FRIEND toward Spamton, along with the fact that he himself is described as \"smelling like meat\" — which…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Man**\nBoth are thematically tied to eggs and to the theory that they serve as \"protein\" for FRIEND — the Forgotten Man hands them out, Spamton produces them.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**[[Huevo|Huevos]], clams, or something else?**\nNot even the game itself agrees: the Check text calls them clams, Spamton calls them eggs (and clarifies that only he has the right to call them that), and they're implied to be edible more than once.","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND's target?**\nTheir nature as a \"protein source\" (along with Spamton himself, described as smelling like meat) puts them at the center of the theory that Spamton is hiding from FRIEND — the same FRIEND that have also been linked…","x":900,"y":-20,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton.gif","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":160,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":420,"y":10,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":194,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":-680,"y":10,"width":210,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5_x0","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e6_x0","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}